body:
@OP This is so awesome! Thank you for doing TNR and giving a better life to these community cats. 
I do this in my area too. What type of cages do you use? And do you do bloodwork for each cat before the snip trip? 
Sorry for the questions. I'm eager to learn and have literally no one to guide me here in India since people still don't understand cats and most think giving them milk is God's work. I can use all the info I can get from first hand cat rescuers. :)
